<title>FINLAND: Finnish October GDP rises 5.7 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Finnish October GDP rises 5.7 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finland's gross domestic product (GDP) rose 5.7 percent year-on-year in October Statistics Finland (SF) said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Adjusted for seasonal factors, GDP rose 0.4 percent in October on September, SF said.</p>
<p>			  Oct 1996     Sept 1996	 Oct 1995</p>
<p> Yr/yr		   5.7 pct	 +4.2 pct	+2.6 pct</p>
<p> Mth/mth		 0.4 pct	 +0.4 pct	+0.1 pct</p>
</text>
